# Layered request flow

```
HTTP → app.ts → routes → controller → service → repository → Prisma
```

| Layer | May | Must not |
|---|---|---|
| Route | middleware, `container.*` | Prisma, `res.json`, business rules |
| Validator | Zod `.strict()` bodies, bearer header | DB calls |
| Controller | log, service, `response.*`, `next(error)` | Prisma, business rules |
| Service | rules, `AppError`, repos/clients | `req`/`res`, Prisma |
| Repository | Prisma, row → DTO | HTTP, 4xx `AppError` |
| `libs/` | shared infra | subscription business rules |

DTOs live in `src/types`. Prisma column names stay in repositories. Other services: `src/clients/` only.
